{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "e2628cb5-e2e3-8598-8f5d-239454e5dcb4",
  "created_at": "2025-12-11T13:37:23-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, City Clerk",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Sofia Teixeira",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Owen Haskell",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-11T13:29:23-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "City Clerk's office, this is Owen. How can I help you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-11T13:29:32-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah, hi. Sofia Teixeira. I'm probably calling at a busy time, right around lunch. So I'll be quick."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-11T13:29:46-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No, no, you're fine. Take your time. What can I do for you today?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-11T13:29:57-05:00",
      "duration": 26,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I got a question about a license. I do alterations out of my house. Sewing, hemming, zippers, that kind of thing. People bring stuff, I fix it. Does that need a license from your office?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-11T13:30:23-05:00",
      "duration": 21,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. So a home business. Let me make sure I understand. You're doing the work inside your home, and customers come to the house. Is that right?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-11T13:30:44-05:00",
      "duration": 19,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Some come by, yeah. Most drop off at the door and pick up a few days later. Maybe six, eight people a week. Nothing crazy."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-11T13:31:03-05:00",
      "duration": 32,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Alright. Generally speaking, a business operating in the city can need some kind of registration or license, and it depends on what the business is. For a home occupation, there can also be a zoning piece, and that's handled by a different office."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-11T13:31:35-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Great. So it's two places. That's the way it goes."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-11T13:31:43-05:00",
      "duration": 19,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It can be, yes. Let me check what we have on our side for something like yours. Can I put you on a short hold?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-11T13:32:02-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Go ahead. I'm not going anywhere."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-11T13:32:07-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thank you. One moment."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-11T13:32:11-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "[pause]"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-11T13:32:13-05:00",
      "duration": 32,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, I'm back. Thanks for waiting. So for a service business like alterations, where you're not selling food or running a shop front, it's usually a simple business registration through us, if it applies at all. Nothing like a restaurant or a salon."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-11T13:32:45-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. And what's the fee? Just give me a number, so I know."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-11T13:32:55-05:00",
      "duration": 31,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I don't want to read you the wrong figure off memory. The fee schedule is posted and I can have it pulled for you. It's not a big amount for this type of thing, but let me get you the exact one."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-11T13:33:26-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Not a big amount. Everybody says that till the bill shows up."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-11T13:33:36-05:00",
      "duration": 16,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Fair enough. Let me take down your address and I'll look at how it's classified. What's the address of the home?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-11T13:33:52-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "146 Coggeshall Avenue. Up on the Hill."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-11T13:33:58-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "146 Coggeshall Avenue. Got it. And you own the house?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-11T13:34:06-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I own it. Twenty-some years."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-11T13:34:11-05:00",
      "duration": 33,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Good, that makes it simpler. If you were renting, we'd want the owner's okay. Since you own it, the main thing is whether zoning allows the home occupation. You'd want to ask the planning and zoning folks about that before you pay anyone anything."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-11T13:34:44-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "So I might pay you for a license and then zoning says no?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-11T13:34:54-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's the order I'd avoid. I'd check zoning first, then come back to us."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-11T13:35:05-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Fine. That's good to know. Can you transfer me over there?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-11T13:35:14-05:00",
      "duration": 19,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I can try. If they don't pick up, I'll get you their voicemail. Do you want me to stay on the line until it rings?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-11T13:35:33-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah, do that. I'm on my cell, so if it drops, you've got my number?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-11T13:35:45-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Let me make sure I have it. Can you give it to me?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-11T13:35:55-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "401-555-0155."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-11T13:35:57-05:00",
      "duration": 15,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "401-555-0155. Okay. I'll note that next to your name. And if I lose you, I'll have somebody call back."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-11T13:36:12-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sounds good."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-11T13:36:14-05:00",
      "duration": 29,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "One more thing before I transfer you. When you come back to us, bring the address, the name you'll operate under, if you have one, and a short description of the work. That's about all we'd need to start."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-11T13:36:43-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "A name? It's just me. Teixeira Alterations, I guess."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-11T13:36:51-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That works. Teixeira, T-E-I-X-E-I-R-A. Is that right?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-11T13:36:57-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's right. Alterations, plain."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-11T13:37:01-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Alright. I've got that written down. Okay, I'm connecting you now. Please hold."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-11T13:37:11-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thanks, Owen. Appreciate the help."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-11T13:37:16-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You're welcome, Ms. Teixeira. Good luck with it."
    }
  ],
